DreamUIFontEmojiKey {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontEmojiData.h#DreamUIFontEmojiKey
    src   "What an emoji data entry is found by: the whole emoji cluster, its code points with U+FE0E and U+FE0F left out (they\npick a presentation, not a picture). A key loaded from before sequences has an empty Sequence and stands for the\none-code-point sequence {EmojiCode}, so old and new keys hash and compare alike and nothing has to be rehashed when\nthe load fills Sequence in (FDreamGUIObjectVersion::EmojiKeyBySequence)."
    text  "表情符号数据条目的查找依据：整个表情符号簇，即去掉 U+FE0E 和 U+FE0F 后的码点（它们\n决定的是呈现形式，而不是图形）。在序列出现之前加载的键其 Sequence 为空，代表\n单码点序列 {EmojiCode}，因此新旧键的哈希与比较结果一致，\n加载时填入 Sequence 无需重新计算哈希（FDreamGUIObjectVersion::EmojiKeyBySequence）。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontEmojiKey:EmojiCode {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontEmojiData.h#DreamUIFontEmojiKey:EmojiCode
    src   "The cluster's base, its first code point: what a key was before sequences, and what FindByCodepoint matches."
    text  "簇的基础，即第一个代码点：这是键在序列之前的状态，也是 FindByCodepoint 匹配的对象。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontEmojiKey:Sequence {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontEmojiData.h#DreamUIFontEmojiKey:Sequence
    src   "Every code point of the cluster in order, variation selectors U+FE0E/U+FE0F left out. Empty: {EmojiCode}."
    text  "按顺序列出该簇的每个码点，不含变体选择符 U+FE0E/U+FE0F。为空时：{EmojiCode}。"
    state machine
}
